---
title: Trail cam
layout: base.jinja
description: "The trail camera's photos, listed from a folder by files(), in a gallery island: click one to see it larger, then the arrow keys."
---
<p>{{ trailCam | length }} photos from the trail camera, listed from the folder by <code>files()</code> in <code>src/_data/trailCam.js</code>. The gallery is an island: click a photo to see it larger, then use the arrow keys, and Escape to close.</p>

<photo-gallery ssqch:load="idle">
  <ul>
    {% for photo in trailCam %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ photo.url }}" data-caption="{{ photo.caption }}">
        <img src="{{ photo.url }}" width="{{ photo.width }}" height="{{ photo.height }}" alt="{{ photo.caption }}" loading="lazy">
      </a>
      <p>{{ photo.caption }} <time datetime="{{ photo.date | dateformat("iso") }}">{{ photo.date | dateformat("%B %-d") }}</time></p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</photo-gallery>
